		PlayerPartyBigFurries: "{PlayerPartyBigFurries}You really like big furries huh?"
		PlayerPartyBigFurryMen: "{PlayerPartyBigFurryMen}You really like big, furry men huh?"
		PlayerPartyBigFurryWomen: "{PlayerPartyBigFurryWomen}You really like big, furry women huh?"
		PlayerPartySmallFurries: "{PlayerPartySmallFurries}You really like furries, don't you?"
		PlayerPartySmallFurryMen: "{PlayerPartySmallFurryMen}You really like furry men, don't you?"
		PlayerPartySmallFurryWomen: "{PlayerPartySmallFurryWomen}You really like furry women, don't you?"
		PlayerPartyAllShrunkenFurries: "{PlayerPartyAllShrunkenFurries}Thank you for shrinking those guardians. It would be cramped in here if you hadn't done that."
		# Macro
		MacroFurryManPresent: "{MacroFurryManPresent}You should be careful around {MacroTerraGuardianName} so he doesn't step on you."
		MacroFurryWomanPresent: "{MacroFurryWomanPresent}You should be careful around {MacroTerraGuardianName} so she doesn't step on you."
		# Guardians
		Alex: Keep that mutt {TerraGuardianAlexName} away from here! Last time it took me hours to scrub off his muddy pawprints from the room!
		Alexander: TODO
		Blue: "{TerraGuardianBlueName} asked me if I could make a lotion for her fur. I mean I could, but I would need a lot more ingredients for someone so large."
		Brutus: TODO
		Ich: TODO
		Leona: TODO
		Monica: TODO
		Rococo: I sure hope that {TerraGuardianRococoName} won't roll around like the other raccoons. The damage would be enormous if he crashed into something.
		Scaleforth: I'm glad that {TerraGuardianScaleforthName} has moved in. He is a very helpful assistant and he can even heat my beakers.
	}

	Game: {
		DragnWash: "{HasGameDragnWash}Oh my, Drag'n Wash... I had no idea you had such a good taste in videogames."
		GameHorror: Do you think {GameNameHorror} is scary? What about Five Nights at Dr K, then?
		GameParty: No I don't want to play {GameNameParty} together. What? I am not bad at it, I just don't like it.
		PawpertyDamage: "{HasGamePawpertyDamage}Pawperty Damage? So you like giant furries crushing things underneath their paws?"
	}
}

